{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alda has a suitcase locked behind an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit combination code that only contains the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8480bbc71e3fd12e3f8b749c49c06897ee7bb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3,4,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />. It is also known that the combination code contains exactly one digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and four digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. How many combination codes satisfy these conditions?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first write the amount of permutations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fddd1f4575afba324923fbd8d10a4b9dfe741a3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1444AAA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, and then we treat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> as if it's not distinct, and then we assign each A with a digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/5785b403681355d362f5f0bdf549d253f6504772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{2,3,5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> (not necessarily distinct). The amount of permutations to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8d0b580bea833db59a08522975e999b7e0b1d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14444AAA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d91b099a287add5d6ba83e14347eaa573f4d6d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8!}{1!4!3!}=280$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"39\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed9eec2e758488fc3b4032ab9649f2567b747a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot3\\cdot3=27$\" width=\"96\" height=\"12\" /> amount of ways to assign each A with a digit, and so the total amount of codes possible is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/7113989cb91a0245ed50033a7ca37dd1ac1a2633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$280\\cdot27=\\boxed{7560}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"132\" height=\"25\" /> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi