0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_District_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2036/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 104/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1942/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.365      1 Template:Indonesia_District_MO_box\n100.00%    8.365      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37817:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035014 and revision id 292218. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}